(22,"alone_w","Say what they are like, not what they did.","you told someone something about their character, to their face.","it to land as strange, or too much, and for them to deflect.","soften","\"You are very steady about things. I notice it.\""),
(23,"wait","Say something about where you both are. That is the whole opener.","a conversation happened with a stranger while you were both waiting.","them to be irritated at being spoken to.","rehearse","\"Any idea how long these usually take?\""),
(24,"alone_w","Ask the first question, then count your own sentences.","you talked less than half the time and you know you did.","to be boring, and for the conversation to die because you held back.","check"),
(25,"known","Ask their name. Nothing else needs to happen.","you know the name and you have used it out loud once.","them to be insulted that you never asked before.","soften","\"I realised I have never asked your name. I am ——.\""),
(26,"msg","Name a day and a time in the message before you send it.","an invitation went out with an actual day and time in it.","them to say no, or to leave it on read.","draft","\"Are you free Thursday evening? I was thinking about ——.\""),
(27,"alone_w","Say the disagreement out loud, calmly, before the moment passes.","you said you disagreed and you did not take it back.","them to be angry, and for the room to turn against you.","soften","\"I see it differently, actually.\""),
