(31,"alone_w","Say the thing you were about to swallow.","the small unsaid thing was said out loud.","it to be unwelcome, and for the mood to change.","soften"),
(32,"laptop","Find one event this week and go without asking anyone to come.","you arrived alone and spoke to two separate people.","to stand at the edge all evening and speak to nobody.","alone","\"Mind if I join you? I came on my own.\""),
(33,"known","Move into the group and say something about what they are discussing.","you joined a conversation you were not part of and stayed in it.","them to stop talking, look at you, and wait for you to leave.","rehearse","\"Sorry — I overheard. Is that the one where ——?\""),
(34,"alone_w","Say it to their face. Not in writing.","you told them, out loud, specifically what you appreciate.","it to be awkward, and for them to not know what to say.","draft","\"I want to say — the thing you did about —— mattered. Thank you.\""),
(35,"laptop","Ask the person you disagree with for two hours of their time.","two hours passed and you stayed curious without conceding.","it to become an argument you cannot get out of.","exit","\"I do not see it that way, but I want to understand how you do.\""),
(36,"known","Ask the first person this week, not the easiest one.","two people gave you a way to contact them inside one week.","them to hesitate, make an excuse, and for you to have read it wrong.","soften","\"Can I take your number? I would like to do this again.\""),
(37,"msg","Pick the date first, then message the three people.","three people turned up to the thing you arranged.","nobody to come, or for it to be flat and awkward.","undo"),
(38,"alone_w","Steer it once, deliberately, toward the thing you care about.","one conversation went past small talk into something that matters to you.","them to be uninterested and to steer it back.","soften"),
(39,"alone_w","Say sorry, name the thing, and stop talking.","the apology was given with no explanation attached to it.","them to not accept it, and for you to have made it worse.","explain","\"I am sorry about ——. There is no excuse for it.\""),
(40,"laptop","Get the number. Then put a reminder in for tomorrow.","you made contact again inside forty-eight hours.","them to not reply, and for the silence to be the answer.","draft","\"Good to meet you yesterday. Fancy a coffee this week?\""),
