(43,"alone_w","Say the first sentence of the conversation you have been dreading.","the dreaded conversation happened, start to finish.","it to go exactly as badly as you have been imagining.","rehearse","\"There is something I need to say and I have been putting it off.\""),
(44,"wake","Say yes to the first invitation before you weigh it up.","every reasonable invitation that day was accepted.","to be dragged into things you hate and lose the whole day.","check"),
(45,"asked","Say what you actually think, without the softening clause.","your honest view was given, unsoftened, when asked for.","them to be hurt, and for honesty to have cost you something.","soften"),
(46,"msg","Open the contact you have not used in a year and write one line.","contact is made with someone you had not spoken to in over a year.","them to be cold, or to not remember why they stopped replying.","draft","\"It has been a long time. I have been thinking about you. How are things?\""),
(47,"alone_w","Sit down and say nothing useful.","you sat with it and offered no solution.","the silence to be unbearable and for you to fill it with advice.","soften","\"That sounds really hard. I am not going to try and fix it.\""),
