(49,"known","Say it in the moment, out loud, in front of whoever is there.","you spoke up for someone else while it was still happening.","the room to turn on you, and for you to have made it worse for them.","soften"),
(50,"asked","Make the request. Stop at the full stop.","the ask was made with no hedge in front and nothing softening behind.","them to say no, and for the directness to have made it worse.","soften","\"I would like ——.\" Then stop."),
